# PR #1157 — CodeRabbit Round-4 Feedback (17 threads)

Branch: fix/1156-fixed-asset-gaap-journals
Typecheck: erp + @carbon/glossary both PASS (turbo, 23s)

## Item 1 — register.tsx (Major)
`apps/erp/app/routes/x+/fixed-asset+/$fixedAssetId.register.tsx`
- The `dimensionsResult.error` rejection was already present (lines 123-131 from a
  prior round). Added the missing required-dimensions guard after resolving
  `locationDimensionId` / `assetClassDimensionId`: if either is absent, redirect to
  the asset with flash "Missing dimensions required for asset registration" — so no
  registration journal can post without the location/asset-class dimensions.
- Matched the existing `throw redirect(path.to.fixedAsset(...), await flash(request,
  error(...)))` pattern used elsewhere in the route.

## Item 2 — Disposal-clearing account: fixed the ROOT CAUSE (Major)
The English glossary definition was self-contradictory: it debits NBV on shipment but
claimed to credit "the proceeds" on invoicing — which cannot net to zero. Verified
against the real posting code `packages/database/supabase/functions/post-sales-invoice/
index.ts:658-663`: invoicing **credits the clearing account for NBV** (`credit("expense",
nbv)`), not proceeds; gain/loss goes to disposalAccountId separately.
- Fixed the source: `packages/glossary/src/terms.ts` (asset-class-write-off-account)
  → "credited for its net book value on invoicing".
- Propagated the msgid change to all 14 erp.po catalogs (mechanical, exact-match sed;
  string is unique per file; not present in any mes.po).
- Updated every locale msgstr for this entry to mirror the NBV term already used on the
  debit side (en, es, fr, de, it, ja, zh, pl, pt, ru, hi, tr, ko). ru specifically:
  "выручки" → "чистой балансовой стоимости".

